        {
          "itemCode": "AAQ_US12_02",
          "content": "觉得某项课程作业太困难或难以理解时，我会选择放弃。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "aaq_us_true_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "AAQ_US12_03",
          "content": "当我感到焦虑或低落时，会发现自己在回避去上课。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "aaq_us_true_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "AAQ_US12_04",
          "content": "在课堂上，我很难集中注意力听老师讲课。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "aaq_us_true_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "AAQ_US12_05",
          "content": "我经常觉得自己不够聪明，不应该在大学或现在的专业学习。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "aaq_us_true_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "AAQ_US12_06",
          "content": "担忧会妨碍我在大学里的学习表现。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "aaq_us_true_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "AAQ_US12_07",
          "content": "与学业有关的各种想法常常让我感到纠结。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "aaq_us_true_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "AAQ_US12_08",
          "content": "我心情不好的时候，会拖延需要完成的大学课程作业。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "aaq_us_true_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "AAQ_US12_09",
          "content": "在学校时，我有时只是机械地走完程序，并没有真正投入。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "aaq_us_true_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "AAQ_US12_10",
          "content": "当脑中有消极想法时，我很难从课堂上获得收获。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": false,
          "sortOrder": 9,
          "responseSetKey": "aaq_us_true_1_7",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
